STK push query

query({ shortCode, checkoutRequestId }) -> BusinessShortCode, Password, Timestamp, CheckoutRequestID. The response maps ResultCode through code(): numeric strings become numbers, others stay strings. Validation: passkey, shortCode, checkoutRequestId required.
